content.description:
Optional initial document body as markdown, excluding the document title and any leading H1 that repeats it. Will be auto-converted to rich text. For a network diagram, use a fenced code block with language nwdiag. Example (illustrative addresses):
```nwdiag
nwdiag {
  network dmz {
    address = "10.0.0.0/24";
    web01 [address = ".10"];
    web02 [address = ".11"];
  }
}
```
